(Episode 1)

18
00:00:46,077 --> 00:00:48,477
(For Rent)

19
00:00:48,547 --> 00:00:50,477
(Mi Mi's Chicken Soup)

20
00:01:31,647 --> 00:01:34,217
(Mi Mi's Chicken Soup)

21
00:01:45,010 --> 00:01:46,010
Oh my.

22
00:01:46,080 --> 00:01:50,320
Choi Da Yeon from Gwangjin District, it is your birthday.

23
00:01:50,380 --> 00:01:54,020
Happy birthday to everyone else celebrating today as well.

24
00:01:54,090 --> 00:01:56,290
Have a wonderful day.

25
00:01:56,360 --> 00:01:57,620
Today is my birthday, too.

26
00:02:06,630 --> 00:02:09,840
Oh, seriously. You are always so impatient.

27
00:02:09,900 --> 00:02:11,840
I told you to wake me up when you leave.

28
00:02:11,900 --> 00:02:12,910
Goodness.

29
00:02:44,770 --> 00:02:46,770
Why are you pouting?

30
00:02:50,040 --> 00:02:54,750
Our lives are just so pathetic. Both yours and mine.

31
00:02:54,810 --> 00:02:56,320
What is it now?

32
00:02:56,380 --> 00:02:58,580
I am talking about our late father.

33
00:02:58,650 --> 00:03:02,260
He wanted us to live beautifully and be loved,

34
00:03:02,320 --> 00:03:04,220
so he named you Mi Mi...

35
00:03:04,290 --> 00:03:06,960
and named me Ri Ja after the Mona Lisa.

36
00:03:07,030 --> 00:03:09,460
He gave us such pretty names,

37
00:03:09,530 --> 00:03:11,660
but I cannot help wondering why our lives turned out like this.

38
00:03:12,900 --> 00:03:15,600
We are healthy, we do not have to worry about our next meal,

39
00:03:15,670 --> 00:03:17,700
and we make a decent living. We are doing fine.

40
00:03:19,670 --> 00:03:23,740
We do not have men in our lives. Neither of us does.

41
00:03:23,810 --> 00:03:26,050
You are still desperate for a man at your age?

42
00:03:26,110 --> 00:03:29,420
Yes, I am. I am dying for one every single day.

43
00:03:29,480 --> 00:03:31,020
Does getting older mean I am no longer a woman?

44
00:03:32,490 --> 00:03:37,090
Are you seriously satisfied with your life right now?

45
00:03:37,160 --> 00:03:40,190
Of course, I am grateful.

46
00:03:40,260 --> 00:03:41,890
Mother is healthy.

47
00:03:41,960 --> 00:03:45,360
Gang Nam met a good woman, got married, and is living well.

48
00:03:45,430 --> 00:03:48,800
Dae Chi and Da Mi are making their own living.

49
00:03:48,870 --> 00:03:52,140
Once I find them partners, I will be completely free.

50
00:03:52,210 --> 00:03:56,710
I suppose. You have a house and a restaurant.

51
00:03:58,640 --> 00:04:00,810
I am even more grateful to Mother for that.

52
00:04:01,980 --> 00:04:05,920
Stop overthinking so early in the morning and hurry up.

53
00:04:06,950 --> 00:04:09,420
But why is Mother not out yet?

54
00:04:10,720 --> 00:04:13,190
- Right. - Is she feeling unwell?

55
00:04:17,430 --> 00:04:20,000
It is always Mother this, Mother that.

56
00:04:20,070 --> 00:04:21,670
People would think she is her biological mother.

57
00:04:25,940 --> 00:04:26,940
Mother.

58
00:04:28,940 --> 00:04:29,940
Mother.

59
00:04:34,210 --> 00:04:39,050
It was a bit expensive, but maybe because it is Wando seaweed?

60
00:04:39,120 --> 00:04:40,890
I made a good purchase.

61
00:04:40,950 --> 00:04:43,320
Mother, are you in the kitchen?

62
00:04:45,860 --> 00:04:47,690
What are you doing, Mother?

63
00:04:47,760 --> 00:04:50,860
Never mind that. Go clean your room.

64
00:04:50,930 --> 00:04:54,430
I will handle breakfast today, so get ready to open the restaurant.

65
00:04:54,500 --> 00:04:55,500
Got it?

66
00:04:56,540 --> 00:04:57,800
Yes, Mother.

67
00:05:03,640 --> 00:05:05,610
Oh, this is no time for me to be standing around.

68
00:05:29,140 --> 00:05:30,870
My eyes are ruined.

69
00:05:30,940 --> 00:05:32,270
Sales are going to be terrible today.

70
00:05:49,860 --> 00:05:53,130
The gaze that meets mine

71
00:05:54,260 --> 00:05:57,260
What is it trying to say

72
00:06:00,300 --> 00:06:01,400
That bastard.

73
00:06:02,740 --> 00:06:05,640
If they fell in love and had kids together,

74
00:06:05,710 --> 00:06:08,470
he should have taken responsibility and lived well until the end.

75
00:06:09,810 --> 00:06:12,650
I cannot even face her.

76
00:06:13,750 --> 00:06:14,880
Seriously.

77
00:06:16,550 --> 00:06:18,680
I still do not know

78
00:06:19,690 --> 00:06:22,620
I really do not know

79
00:06:22,690 --> 00:06:24,260
Only my heart

80
00:06:24,320 --> 00:06:25,790
(Mijang Meat Market)

81
00:06:25,930 --> 00:06:26,930
Oh, my.

82
00:06:26,990 --> 00:06:28,890
(Hanma Meat Distribution)

83
00:06:28,960 --> 00:06:31,860
Oh, ma'am, you are out early today.

84
00:06:31,930 --> 00:06:34,600
You should have just called since your legs are bothering you.

85
00:06:34,670 --> 00:06:36,200
I would have delivered it to you.

86
00:06:36,270 --> 00:06:38,570
Give me the best Korean beef you have.

87
00:06:38,640 --> 00:06:40,840
Some for soup and some for grilling.

88
00:06:40,910 --> 00:06:42,210
Oh, sure.

89
00:06:42,270 --> 00:06:46,510
- Is it a special occasion? - Yes. It is our Mi Mi's birthday.

90
00:06:46,580 --> 00:06:48,610
So you have to give me the highest quality.

91
00:06:48,680 --> 00:06:51,520
Oh. Yes, of course. Please wait a moment.

92
00:06:51,580 --> 00:06:54,550
Oh, right, I will pack the beef neck separately.

93
00:06:54,620 --> 00:06:57,960
It is my birthday gift for Ms. Jo. Please make sure to tell her.

94
00:06:58,020 --> 00:07:01,690
- Yes. Bless you. - Oh, thank you.

95
00:07:06,270 --> 00:07:08,570
(New Employee Recruitment Notice)

96
00:07:08,630 --> 00:07:09,840
(Creative Fashion Design Contest)

97
00:07:13,370 --> 00:07:14,670
(Kang Da Mi! You can do it. Paris, wait! Da Mi is the best!)

98
00:07:14,740 --> 00:07:15,880
(My thirties in New York, I can do it!)

99
00:07:30,990 --> 00:07:32,630
Look at this.

100
00:07:32,690 --> 00:07:36,430
You look completely crazy, just without a flower in your hair.

101
00:07:37,660 --> 00:07:38,700
Ms. Kang Da Mi.

102
00:07:39,900 --> 00:07:41,600
Wake up. I said, wake up.

103
00:07:43,800 --> 00:07:45,270
I was only going to sleep for five more minutes.

104
00:07:45,270 --> 00:07:46,940
Why did you wake me, Mom?

105
00:07:47,010 --> 00:07:49,510
You would have thrown a fit if I did not wake you up.

106
00:07:54,580 --> 00:07:56,650
When are you leaving?

107
00:07:56,720 --> 00:07:58,750
I have to wash up before I leave.

108
00:07:58,820 --> 00:08:01,320
Oh, my. I meant, when are you moving out?

109
00:08:04,090 --> 00:08:06,630
You are turning 30 soon.

110
00:08:06,690 --> 00:08:08,130
You have not even dated once at that age.

111
00:08:08,190 --> 00:08:09,360
Will you grow old and die in this house?

112
00:08:10,360 --> 00:08:12,700
I did not fail to date. I chose not to.

113
00:08:12,770 --> 00:08:14,700
You are all talk.

114
00:08:14,770 --> 00:08:15,940
Please move out quickly.

115
00:08:16,000 --> 00:08:17,500
By the end of this year, no matter what.

116
00:08:17,570 --> 00:08:18,570
Got it?

117
00:08:22,370 --> 00:08:23,380
Sweetie.

118
00:08:24,810 --> 00:08:26,980
Do you know what day it is today?

119
00:08:27,050 --> 00:08:28,980
No, what day is it?

120
00:08:29,050 --> 00:08:31,750
Oh? No, never mind.

121
00:08:31,820 --> 00:08:33,490
Hurry up and wash up, then come down to eat.

122
00:08:35,520 --> 00:08:37,120
Grandma...

123
00:08:37,190 --> 00:08:39,090
I think she is making seaweed soup.

124
00:08:39,160 --> 00:08:42,160
She bought the highest quality Wando seaweed.

125
00:08:42,230 --> 00:08:43,230
Okay?

126
00:08:45,360 --> 00:08:46,430
Hey.

127
00:08:46,500 --> 00:08:50,370
- Oh, my, it is so messy, oh, my. - I am not eating breakfast, Mom.

128
00:08:50,440 --> 00:08:51,770
I have a lot of reservations today.

129
00:08:55,240 --> 00:08:58,110
Living expenses would be so high if I moved out.

130
00:08:58,180 --> 00:08:59,810
Until I reach my goal amount,

131
00:08:59,880 --> 00:09:02,380
that is never going to happen, Your Majesty.

132
00:09:04,820 --> 00:09:08,420
Your daughter, Kang Da Mi, will reach her goal amount...

133
00:09:08,490 --> 00:09:11,060
and definitely get into here or here.

134
00:09:11,120 --> 00:09:12,360
I will make it happen.

135
00:09:22,670 --> 00:09:24,170
Is that you, Mother?

136
00:09:24,240 --> 00:09:26,240
Who else would it be?

137
00:09:26,310 --> 00:09:27,640
I am not a thief.

138
00:09:37,450 --> 00:09:38,480
Mother.

139
00:09:40,990 --> 00:09:43,420
I soaked it for a while,

140
00:09:43,490 --> 00:09:44,890
so it is good to eat, dear.

141
00:09:52,330 --> 00:09:54,770
Are you going to stand there and drink the seaweed soup?

142
00:09:56,270 --> 00:09:57,940
No, no, Mother.

143
00:10:01,240 --> 00:10:02,440
That is not it...

144
00:10:04,810 --> 00:10:05,810
Dear.

145
00:10:07,450 --> 00:10:08,780
Yes.

146
00:10:08,850 --> 00:10:11,380
Thank you for being born.

147
00:10:11,450 --> 00:10:13,220
And you have worked hard in life.

148
00:10:15,190 --> 00:10:16,590
Mother,

149
00:10:16,660 --> 00:10:19,590
the kids' father also has his birthday this month.

150
00:10:19,660 --> 00:10:22,530
I always feel guilty.

151
00:10:22,600 --> 00:10:25,600
That wretched man, whether he is dead or alive somewhere,

152
00:10:25,660 --> 00:10:28,930
I do not care at all. Do not ever say that again.

153
00:10:30,870 --> 00:10:33,070
Da Mi says she is leaving without breakfast.

154
00:10:33,140 --> 00:10:34,910
She must be busy.

155
00:10:34,970 --> 00:10:38,640
What about Gang Nam and Dae Chi? It is their mother's birthday.

156
00:10:38,710 --> 00:10:40,350
Has Mi Seon not called either?

157
00:10:41,380 --> 00:10:43,050
I am sure everyone will gather tonight.

158
00:10:47,020 --> 00:10:50,260
Oh, it is delicious, Mother.

159
00:10:50,320 --> 00:10:52,460
I am truly blessed, right?

160
00:10:53,830 --> 00:10:55,090
Nonsense.

161
00:11:03,100 --> 00:11:04,100
This hits the spot.

162
00:11:27,090 --> 00:11:29,430
That woman is probably feeding him well.

163
00:11:30,700 --> 00:11:31,960
Why should I care?

164
00:11:33,200 --> 00:11:36,440
A guy who has not sent a letter to his mother in over 20 years...

165
00:11:36,500 --> 00:11:37,970
is no son of mine.

166
00:11:39,740 --> 00:11:40,770
Ri Ja.

167
00:11:41,910 --> 00:11:43,110
Mona Ri Ja.

168
00:11:44,210 --> 00:11:45,280
Mom!

169
00:11:47,450 --> 00:11:48,880
Are you running late?

170
00:11:48,950 --> 00:11:50,580
You should have at least a bite before you go.

171
00:11:51,720 --> 00:11:54,250
- Seaweed soup? - Yes.

172
00:11:54,320 --> 00:11:56,760
I told you your grandmother made it.

173
00:11:56,820 --> 00:12:00,990
- Actually, today is my... - I hate seaweed soup.

174
00:12:01,060 --> 00:12:02,060
I am heading out.

175
00:12:07,500 --> 00:12:09,400
- I am leaving, Aunt Ri Ja. - Oh, okay.

176
00:12:09,470 --> 00:12:11,500
Hey, Kang Da.

177
00:12:11,570 --> 00:12:12,940
What is it?

178
00:12:13,010 --> 00:12:16,510
Do you know what day it is today?

179
00:12:16,580 --> 00:12:17,580
No.

180
00:12:18,780 --> 00:12:19,780
Oh, right.

181
00:12:22,950 --> 00:12:24,180
Right.

182
00:12:24,250 --> 00:12:26,850
You work yourself to the bone raising them.

183
00:12:26,920 --> 00:12:28,520
They say when a woman is in her twilight years,

184
00:12:28,590 --> 00:12:30,720
a daughter is better than a son.

185
00:12:30,790 --> 00:12:32,320
- Oh my. - Mom.

186
00:12:32,390 --> 00:12:33,730
Mom.

187
00:12:33,790 --> 00:12:34,830
What is it, sweetie?

188
00:12:36,530 --> 00:12:38,760
Did you forget something again?

189
00:12:38,830 --> 00:12:43,500
Yes, I almost had a huge disaster. Hold on.

190
00:12:43,570 --> 00:12:45,900
Oh, you are too much.

191
00:12:45,970 --> 00:12:47,870
What is it?

192
00:12:47,940 --> 00:12:48,940
Here it is.

193
00:12:49,940 --> 00:12:53,550
Can you go to the dry cleaner this afternoon to get my clothes?

194
00:12:53,610 --> 00:12:55,280
I really need to wear them tomorrow.

195
00:12:56,350 --> 00:13:00,390
You want me to pick up your clothes from the dry cleaner?

196
00:13:00,450 --> 00:13:02,150
Yes, you just need to pick them up.

197
00:13:02,220 --> 00:13:03,460
I already paid when I dropped them off.

198
00:13:04,560 --> 00:13:05,660
Oh, and...

199
00:13:05,720 --> 00:13:09,060
Please do not clean my room, Mom. Thank you.

200
00:13:12,560 --> 00:13:16,770
Gosh, I stretch morning and night, but why am I not losing any weight?

201
00:13:19,410 --> 00:13:21,640
What did you get? A gift card?

202
00:13:22,670 --> 00:13:25,540
Well...

203
00:13:25,610 --> 00:13:27,880
The soup is getting cold. Just eat.

204
00:13:27,950 --> 00:13:31,020
Oh, stop hiding it. Who is going to steal it?

205
00:13:31,080 --> 00:13:32,320
How much is it?

206
00:13:41,930 --> 00:13:44,030
Why are you staring at me like that?

207
00:13:44,100 --> 00:13:45,400
Because you are beautiful.

208
00:13:46,530 --> 00:13:49,700
You are exactly the same as when we first met.

209
00:13:49,770 --> 00:13:52,640
No, you are getting more beautiful every day.

210
00:13:56,010 --> 00:13:57,010
Just tell me.

211
00:13:58,110 --> 00:13:59,280
What did you do wrong?

212
00:14:00,350 --> 00:14:02,380
No, if I wronged a good woman like you,

213
00:14:02,450 --> 00:14:03,980
I would be punished by fate.

214
00:14:05,920 --> 00:14:07,320
For our anniversary gift,

215
00:14:07,390 --> 00:14:09,490
I ordered a necklace and bracelet set,

216
00:14:09,560 --> 00:14:12,760
- and I hope you like it. - What should I do?

217
00:14:12,830 --> 00:14:15,990
I have not picked out a gift for you yet.

218
00:14:16,060 --> 00:14:18,630
How could you have had the time to think about it?

219
00:14:18,700 --> 00:14:21,270
You are taking care of Mother, and Seung Yun is returning soon.

220
00:14:21,330 --> 00:14:23,400
It is only natural that you have no time to worry about it.

221
00:14:24,400 --> 00:14:26,100
Do not worry about getting me anything.

222
00:14:26,170 --> 00:14:29,040
You are already doing more than enough for me.

223
00:14:30,940 --> 00:14:32,210
After I go to work,

224
00:14:32,280 --> 00:14:35,580
I will stop by the department store to pick out a dress this afternoon.

225
00:14:35,650 --> 00:14:38,120
I hope they have something that fits the restaurant's atmosphere.

226
00:14:38,180 --> 00:14:41,050
Oh, I heard the personal shopper there is good at their job.

227
00:14:41,120 --> 00:14:42,990
I have not been disappointed yet.

228
00:14:44,760 --> 00:14:46,230
But honey,

229
00:14:46,290 --> 00:14:49,030
can we invite Do Yun to our anniversary dinner too?

230
00:14:49,090 --> 00:14:53,900
- Se Na will probably say no anyway. - Oh, what should we do?

231
00:14:53,970 --> 00:14:57,370
I want to spend our anniversary just the two of us.

232
00:14:57,440 --> 00:14:58,740
Oh, that boy.

233
00:14:58,800 --> 00:15:00,770
Let us just find him a partner and get him married off quickly.

234
00:15:00,840 --> 00:15:03,410
How long are you going to keep babying Do Yun?

235
00:15:03,480 --> 00:15:06,480
Our son Do Yun is my entire universe.

236
00:15:06,550 --> 00:15:07,550
You know that.

237
00:15:11,420 --> 00:15:12,890
That feels refreshing.

238
00:15:12,950 --> 00:15:14,620
That is right.

239
00:15:14,690 --> 00:15:17,590
Wow, look how lovely your hands are.

240
00:15:18,720 --> 00:15:20,790
Your face is beautiful too.

241
00:15:20,860 --> 00:15:23,030
Grandmother, what is your secret?

242
00:15:23,100 --> 00:15:24,360
Money.

243
00:15:24,430 --> 00:15:26,770
- And... - What else besides money?

244
00:15:29,200 --> 00:15:31,240
This moisturizer.

245
00:15:31,300 --> 00:15:33,670
I have been using only this for decades.

246
00:15:39,180 --> 00:15:40,180
Let us see...

247
00:15:40,250 --> 00:15:42,450
Grandmother, your black tea is ready.

248
00:15:42,510 --> 00:15:43,520
Okay.

249
00:15:46,850 --> 00:15:48,090
How is she today?

250
00:15:48,150 --> 00:15:49,520
She is lucid.

251
00:15:49,590 --> 00:15:50,860
You did it wrong.

252
00:15:50,920 --> 00:15:52,220
Why, Grandmother?

253
00:15:52,290 --> 00:15:53,930
Your granddaughter made it perfectly.

254
00:15:53,990 --> 00:15:57,060
You should have warmed the teacup with lukewarm water first...

255
00:15:57,130 --> 00:15:58,600
before pouring the tea.

256
00:15:58,660 --> 00:16:02,830
Why is Ms. Ma not coming to work?

257
00:16:02,900 --> 00:16:04,900
Oh, you kicked Ms. Ma out, Grandmother.

258
00:16:04,970 --> 00:16:07,540
- You are doing it again. - Did I?

259
00:16:08,910 --> 00:16:10,410
Oh, Ms. Ma...

260
00:16:10,480 --> 00:16:11,940
Tell Ms. Ma to come here quickly.

261
00:16:13,480 --> 00:16:14,810
What?

262
00:16:14,880 --> 00:16:15,950
What is wrong with her?

263
00:16:16,010 --> 00:16:19,720
Grandmother keeps asking us to bring Ms. Ma back, Mom.

264
00:16:19,790 --> 00:16:23,790
Mother, Ms. Ma quit her job. Do you not remember?

265
00:16:24,890 --> 00:16:28,760
She really quit?

266
00:16:28,830 --> 00:16:32,230
I do not remember that at all.

267
00:16:32,300 --> 00:16:35,770
That can happen. I am always forgetting things too.

268
00:16:35,830 --> 00:16:38,170
Still, she worked for our family for three years,

269
00:16:38,240 --> 00:16:40,140
so she lasted a long time.

270
00:16:40,210 --> 00:16:41,710
Mother.

271
00:16:41,770 --> 00:16:44,940
Do Yun's mother wants someone who is as good as Ms. Ma. No,

272
00:16:45,010 --> 00:16:48,610
someone who will work much better and longer than Ms. Ma.

273
00:16:48,680 --> 00:16:50,550
So please be patient even if it is inconvenient.

274
00:16:51,980 --> 00:16:54,620
- We are heading to work, Mother. - I will see you later, Grandmother.

275
00:16:55,920 --> 00:17:00,630
My mind is perfectly fine. Do not try any funny business.

276
00:17:00,690 --> 00:17:01,790
Just because I am an old woman stuck at home,

277
00:17:01,860 --> 00:17:04,030
do not just check on me once in a while.

278
00:17:04,100 --> 00:17:06,230
I will not leave you even a penny.

279
00:17:08,570 --> 00:17:10,540
What are you doing?

280
00:17:10,600 --> 00:17:12,770
Bring me some fresh black tea.

281
00:17:12,840 --> 00:17:15,610
Yes. Please wait a moment, Grandmother.

282
00:17:27,790 --> 00:17:29,660
About that housekeeper.

283
00:17:29,720 --> 00:17:32,890
- Is it still hard to find one? - I am looking into it,

284
00:17:32,960 --> 00:17:36,190
but Mother's condition is so unpredictable.

285
00:17:36,260 --> 00:17:37,930
And it seems rumours are spreading.

286
00:17:39,130 --> 00:17:40,870
What rumours?

287
00:17:40,930 --> 00:17:42,800
You do not need to worry about it, son.

288
00:17:42,870 --> 00:17:44,100
I will take care of everything.

289
00:17:45,840 --> 00:17:48,440
I will find someone reliable as soon as possible.

290
00:17:48,510 --> 00:17:50,240
You are going through a lot.

291
00:17:50,310 --> 00:17:53,110
- I am sorry. - She is my mother, too.

292
00:17:53,180 --> 00:17:55,450
Do not worry and let's get going, honey.

293
00:17:57,650 --> 00:17:58,650
I love you, honey.

294
00:18:00,590 --> 00:18:01,590
I love you, son.

295
00:18:36,460 --> 00:18:38,690
By the way, you and Father are strange.

296
00:18:38,760 --> 00:18:39,960
You are both owners,

297
00:18:40,030 --> 00:18:42,030
so why do you refuse to hire a driver?

298
00:18:42,090 --> 00:18:44,530
Because your father and I both like driving.

299
00:18:44,600 --> 00:18:47,070
We can hire one later if it gets inconvenient.

300
00:18:47,130 --> 00:18:50,140
Besides, riding in the car my son drives...

301
00:18:50,200 --> 00:18:53,540
on the way to work is the joy of starting my day.

302
00:18:53,610 --> 00:18:56,170
Wow, your love for your son is too much.

303
00:18:56,240 --> 00:18:57,240
Let's go.

304
00:19:13,060 --> 00:19:16,800
Welcome. Good morning, CEO Jeon, Team Leader Cha.

305
00:19:16,860 --> 00:19:19,500
Oh, Assistant Manager Kang. Was our meeting not at ten o'clock?

306
00:19:19,560 --> 00:19:22,200
Yes, it is. I had some good news,

307
00:19:22,270 --> 00:19:25,340
so I was waiting to report it to you quickly.

308
00:19:25,400 --> 00:19:27,540
You mean skipping over me, your team leader?

309
00:19:27,610 --> 00:19:30,580
I apologize if I offended you. I...

310
00:19:30,640 --> 00:19:33,180
judged this to be a matter to report directly to CEO Jeon.

311
00:19:34,410 --> 00:19:35,750
Team Leader Cha.

312
00:19:35,810 --> 00:19:37,350
Looking at Assistant Manager Kang's face,

313
00:19:37,420 --> 00:19:39,790
it seems there is a special issue.

314
00:19:41,890 --> 00:19:43,320
Then go ahead and give your report first.

315
00:19:56,800 --> 00:19:58,500
Is my son not so handsome?

316
00:19:58,570 --> 00:20:00,040
Excuse me?

317
00:20:00,110 --> 00:20:04,110
Yes, he is a good person. And he is capable.

318
00:20:04,180 --> 00:20:07,010
He is top husband material, someone anyone would covet.

319
00:20:14,450 --> 00:20:15,450
Oh my.

320
00:20:16,990 --> 00:20:18,320
Am I number one again this year?

321
00:20:18,390 --> 00:20:20,260
I should give you an award.

322
00:20:20,330 --> 00:20:21,890
Congratulations, CEO Jeon.

323
00:20:21,960 --> 00:20:24,300
For three years in a row, you were ranked the top female executive...

324
00:20:24,360 --> 00:20:27,030
that college students want to emulate.

325
00:20:27,100 --> 00:20:28,370
I am also very happy.

326
00:20:29,570 --> 00:20:32,200
I thought CEO Lee of Korea Hotel would be chosen this year.

327
00:20:33,670 --> 00:20:34,670
Did you select the photos...

328
00:20:34,740 --> 00:20:37,410
and give the final confirmation for the article yourself?

329
00:20:37,480 --> 00:20:39,210
Yes.

330
00:20:39,280 --> 00:20:42,580
But the photos feel a bit different from last year.

331
00:20:42,650 --> 00:20:45,450
We needed to differentiate you from the owners of other companies.

332
00:20:45,520 --> 00:20:46,920
The photos of the owners...

333
00:20:46,990 --> 00:20:48,750
usually focus on their appearance and...

334
00:20:48,820 --> 00:20:50,960
facial expressions as a standard practice,

335
00:20:51,020 --> 00:20:52,920
but I wanted to boldly break that convention...

336
00:20:52,990 --> 00:20:55,790
and convey your unique story, CEO Jeon.

337
00:20:56,900 --> 00:20:59,900
I actively communicated that idea to the photographer,

338
00:20:59,970 --> 00:21:02,200
and we decided on the photos where your gaze is directed at...

339
00:21:02,270 --> 00:21:03,840
the bright faces of the orphanage children...

340
00:21:03,900 --> 00:21:07,140
and the homeless people. Posting those on the site...

341
00:21:07,210 --> 00:21:08,670
is what got such a great response.

342
00:21:09,670 --> 00:21:11,480
Great work.

343
00:21:11,540 --> 00:21:13,650
Pick a date soon and let me know in advance.

344
00:21:13,710 --> 00:21:15,550
Let us have a meal together.

345
00:21:15,610 --> 00:21:17,720
Yes, thank you, CEO Jeon.

346
00:21:17,780 --> 00:21:19,480
(CEO Jeon Jin Hee)

347
00:21:20,490 --> 00:21:23,660
What are you doing? Go back to work.

348
00:21:23,720 --> 00:21:24,720
Right, yes.

349
00:21:26,220 --> 00:21:28,230
(CEO Jeon Jin Hee)

350
00:21:33,600 --> 00:21:34,600
Look at her.

351
00:21:35,870 --> 00:21:36,900
She is quite something.

352
00:21:47,010 --> 00:21:48,610
(Mom)

353
00:21:50,780 --> 00:21:52,820
Oh, Ye Ri, how did it go?

354
00:21:52,880 --> 00:21:55,620
Mom, CEO Jeon loves it.

355
00:21:55,690 --> 00:21:57,920
Plus, she said she would treat me to a meal.

356
00:21:59,620 --> 00:22:02,660
I am so proud of you, my daughter. So proud.

357
00:22:02,730 --> 00:22:04,900
Mom, just wait a little longer.

358
00:22:04,960 --> 00:22:07,870
I will let you spend money freely until you fall asleep.

359
00:22:12,170 --> 00:22:13,970
(K Department Store)

360
00:22:19,080 --> 00:22:21,410
(K Department Store)

361
00:22:28,950 --> 00:22:30,420
Yes, we are all set.

362
00:22:32,360 --> 00:22:33,430
Manager Kang.

363
00:22:33,490 --> 00:22:35,990
CEO Jeon Jin Hee of Hwanggeum Apparel is on her way up.

364
00:22:37,730 --> 00:22:39,700
- Are you that nervous? - Yes.

365
00:22:39,760 --> 00:22:41,830
Strangely, whenever I see CEO Jeon...

366
00:22:43,070 --> 00:22:44,770
She just has strict tastes,

367
00:22:44,840 --> 00:22:46,970
but she is not a bad person, so relax.

368
00:22:48,010 --> 00:22:50,410
Still, I can handle it because you are here.

369
00:22:51,740 --> 00:22:53,380
I was like that at first too.

370
00:22:53,450 --> 00:22:54,850
Let us trust each other and do our best.

371
00:22:54,910 --> 00:22:56,410
(K Department Store)

372
00:23:00,020 --> 00:23:02,190
How have you been, CEO Jeon?

373
00:23:02,250 --> 00:23:03,820
Have you been well, Manager Kang?

374
00:23:06,360 --> 00:23:07,560
You are glowing.

375
00:23:07,630 --> 00:23:09,790
How do you get prettier every time I see you?

376
00:23:09,860 --> 00:23:11,460
Thank you.

377
00:23:11,530 --> 00:23:15,070
First, congratulations on your upcoming wedding anniversary.

378
00:23:15,130 --> 00:23:18,040
To match the atmosphere of the restaurant you mentioned,

379
00:23:18,040 --> 00:23:19,970
I have prepared a total of six dresses.

380
00:23:20,040 --> 00:23:21,140
Would you like to take a look?

381
00:23:32,150 --> 00:23:36,090
I do like it, but is the neckline not too low?

382
00:23:36,150 --> 00:23:37,690
You do not have any neck wrinkles, CEO Jeon,

383
00:23:37,760 --> 00:23:39,060
and your neckline is so delicate,

384
00:23:39,120 --> 00:23:41,790
so I think it will look great on you.

385
00:23:41,860 --> 00:23:43,130
Would you like to try it on?

386
00:23:44,960 --> 00:23:47,700
Since you recommend it so confidently, Da Mi,

387
00:23:47,770 --> 00:23:48,900
I will try it on.

388
00:23:58,480 --> 00:24:00,410
If you feel uncomfortable or need any help,

389
00:24:00,480 --> 00:24:01,680
please call me, CEO Jeon.

390
00:24:07,820 --> 00:24:10,190
What? Why is my sister-in-law calling?

391
00:24:12,290 --> 00:24:14,190
Min Hee, I will go take this call for a second.

392
00:24:14,260 --> 00:24:16,630
It seems urgent. I will be right back.

393
00:24:21,330 --> 00:24:22,470
These kids...

394
00:24:24,200 --> 00:24:26,700
They only look for their mom when they need something.

395
00:24:30,110 --> 00:24:31,180
(Kang Gang Nam, Eldest Son)

396
00:24:36,410 --> 00:24:39,080
(Mom)

397
00:24:44,390 --> 00:24:46,020
I am all out of cash, too.

398
00:24:47,360 --> 00:24:49,860
And Mom is the only person I can lean on.

399
00:24:52,430 --> 00:24:53,670
What am I going to do?

400
00:25:01,970 --> 00:25:03,110
Oh, man.

401
00:25:06,510 --> 00:25:08,280
(Kang Dae Chi, Second Son)

402
00:25:10,450 --> 00:25:12,850
Mom, I am busy right now. I will call you later.

403
00:25:16,020 --> 00:25:17,260
Right.

404
00:25:17,320 --> 00:25:19,220
That is my fate for having such successful sons.

405
00:25:29,470 --> 00:25:30,570
The 200,000 dollars you promised to send,

406
00:25:30,640 --> 00:25:32,800
when is it coming in?

407
00:25:32,870 --> 00:25:35,270
He still has not read it. Darn it.

408
00:25:35,340 --> 00:25:36,810
He has not come to work for days.

409
00:25:37,880 --> 00:25:39,480
Did this jerk go into hiding?

410
00:25:43,050 --> 00:25:44,250
Darn it.

411
00:25:46,580 --> 00:25:47,950
(Kang Da Mi, Youngest)

412
00:25:49,090 --> 00:25:50,460
The customer you are calling is on another line,

413
00:25:50,520 --> 00:25:52,190
so you are being connected to voicemail.

414
00:25:55,990 --> 00:26:00,300
Still, my daughter-in-law Mi Seon would never forget my birthday.

415
00:26:03,170 --> 00:26:04,540
Is Su Ah sick?

416
00:26:10,310 --> 00:26:13,710
Yes, Mi Seon. It has been a while. Is something wrong?

417
00:26:13,780 --> 00:26:16,410
Da Mi, today is your mother's birthday.

418
00:26:16,480 --> 00:26:18,650
Did you make her seaweed soup this morning?

419
00:26:18,720 --> 00:26:20,120
Today is Mom's birthday?

420
00:26:21,650 --> 00:26:26,260
I completely forgot. So that is why Mom...

421
00:26:26,320 --> 00:26:28,690
You were always the one who took care of it.

422
00:26:29,930 --> 00:26:32,700
That is not much of an excuse. She is my mom after all.

423
00:26:33,770 --> 00:26:35,430
Mi Seon, are you and Gang Nam coming over tonight?

424
00:26:35,500 --> 00:26:38,170
No, I cannot go anymore.

425
00:26:38,240 --> 00:26:40,210
What do you mean you cannot come anymore? What is...

426
00:26:40,270 --> 00:26:41,840
I am sorry, Da Mi.

427
00:26:41,910 --> 00:26:45,380
Your mother likes cheesecake, so buy one on your way home from work.

428
00:26:45,440 --> 00:26:46,440
I am hanging up.

429
00:26:47,950 --> 00:26:48,950
Mi Seon?

430
00:26:50,650 --> 00:26:51,650
What was that about?

431
00:26:54,890 --> 00:26:57,620
(Mi Mi's Chicken Soup)

432
00:27:41,800 --> 00:27:44,100
(Mission: Mompossible)

433
00:27:45,100 --> 00:27:46,700
Did Mi Seon really not come?

434
00:27:46,770 --> 00:27:51,640
Neither Gang Nam nor Dae Chi came. Your mom was wary of the in-laws,

435
00:27:51,710 --> 00:27:54,380
so she did not say anything, but imagine how upset she must be.

436
00:27:54,450 --> 00:27:55,450
- The one from earlier. - No...

437
00:27:55,510 --> 00:27:57,150
You are the department store employee, right?

438
00:27:57,220 --> 00:28:00,120
I am sorry, but could I buy this cake?

439
00:28:00,180 --> 00:28:02,490
You are really pushing it to the end.

440
00:28:02,550 --> 00:28:04,120
Manager Kang,

441
00:28:04,190 --> 00:28:05,820
are you not going to live to see tomorrow?

442
00:28:05,890 --> 00:28:07,390
Yes.

443
00:28:07,460 --> 00:28:08,460
I suppose so.

444
00:28:15,570 --> 00:28:16,830
(Mission: Mompossible)
